  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you present your Holy Symbol and expend a use of your Channel Divinity to emit a flash of light in a 30-foot Emanation originating from you. Any magical Darkness in that area, such as that of the Darkness spell, is dispelled, and each creature of your choice in it must make a Constitution saving throw, taking Radiant damage equal to 2d10 plus your Cleric level on a failure or half as much on a success.</p>",
